#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:2
msgid "Azure Active Directory SSO (SAML)"
msgstr "Azure Active Directory SSO (SAML)"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:4
msgid ""
"Azure Active Directory Single Sign-on can be added as a Identity Source in "
"|morpheus| using the SAML Identity Source Type. The Azure AD SSO "
"configuration is slightly different than other SAML providers, and this "
"guide will assist in adding a Azure AD SSO Identity Source."
msgstr ""
"Azure Active Directory Single Sign-on se puede agregar as un Identity Source"
" in |morpheus| using el SAML Identity Source Type. The Azure AD SSO "
"configuración es slightly diferente than otro SAML proveedores, y este guía "
"será assist in adding un Azure AD SSO Identity Source."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:8
msgid "Create Azure Enterprise Application"
msgstr "Create Azure Enterprise Application"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:10
msgid "Login to the `Azure Portal <https://portal.azure.com>`_"
msgstr "Login to el `Azure Portal <https://portal.azure.com>`_"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:11
msgid "Navigate to: ``Azure Active Directory > Enterprise Applications``"
msgstr "Navegue un: ``Azure Active Directory > Enterprise Applications``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:12
msgid "Click the ``+ New application`` button at the top"
msgstr "Haga clic en el ``+ New application`` botón en la parte superior"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:13
msgid "Click the ``+ Create your own application`` button at the top"
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en el ``+ Create your own application`` botón en la parte superior"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:14
msgid ""
"Ensure ``Integrate any other application you don't find in the gallery (Non-"
"gallery)`` is selected and enter a name for the app.  Common examples are:  "
"``MorpheusSSO``"
msgstr ""
"Ensure ``Integrate any other application you don't find in the gallery (Non-"
"gallery)`` es seleccionado y enter un nombre para el app.  Common ejemplos "
"son:  ``MorpheusSSO``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:15
msgid "Click the ``Create`` button at the bottom and wait for it to complete"
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en el ``Create`` botón en la parte inferior y wait para it to "
"completo"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:16
msgid ""
"Once created, you'll be in the ``Overview`` of the application created.  "
"Navigate to the ``Single sign-on`` section from the left pane"
msgstr ""
"Una vez creado, you'll be in el ``Overview`` of el application creado.  "
"Navegue un el ``Single sign-on`` sección desde el left pane"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:17
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:62
msgid "Choose ``SAML`` as the Single sign-on method"
msgstr "Choose ``SAML`` as el Single sign-on método"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:18
msgid ""
"Copy both the ``Login URL`` and ``Logout URL`` in Step 4, we'll need these "
"in some of the next steps"
msgstr ""
"Copy both el ``Login URL`` y ``Logout URL`` in Step 4, we'll need estos in "
"algunos of el siguiente pasos"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:19
msgid ""
"Before we can continue configuring the application, the configuration needs "
"to be generated in |morpheus| for more data"
msgstr ""
"Before we puede continue configuring el application, el configuración "
"necesita ser generated in |morpheus| para más datos"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:22
msgid "Create an Azure AD SAML Integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Create un Azure AD SAML Integration in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:24
msgid ""
"Azure requires inputting the ``Identifier (Entity ID)`` and ``Reply URL "
"(Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` in the Azure SSO configuration before it "
"provides the Endpoints and Certificate necessary to add the Integration into"
" |morpheus|. In order to get the ``Identifier (Entity ID)`` and ``Reply URL "
"(Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` to input into Azure SSO configuration, we"
" need to create a ``Azure AD SAML SSO`` integration in |morpheus| first."
msgstr ""
"Azure requires inputting el ``Identifier (Entity ID)`` y ``Reply URL "
"(Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` in el Azure SSO configuración antes de it"
" provides el Endpoints y Certificate necesario to add el Integration en "
"|morpheus|. In order to get el ``Identifier (Entity ID)`` y ``Reply URL "
"(Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` to entrada en Azure SSO configuración, we"
" need to create un ``Azure AD SAML SSO`` integration in |morpheus| primero."

