#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:113
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use ``Microsoft Edge``, or another browser, to view the"
" contents"
msgstr ""
"It es recomendado to use ``Microsoft Edge``, o another browser, to view el "
