"contents between the ``<X509Certificate>`` and ``</X509Certificate>``, it is"
" very long"
msgstr ""
"En el ``Federation Metadata XML`` archivo, locate el ``<X509Certificate> "
"</X509Certificate>`` under el ``<Signature>`` sección.  Copy el entire "
"contents entre el ``<X509Certificate>`` y ``</X509Certificate>``, it es muy "
"long"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:116
msgid ""
"Paste the value copied from the ``Federation Metadata XML`` file into the "
"``Public Key (Optional)`` box, below the ``SAML RESPONSE`` dropdown"
msgstr ""
"Paste el valor copied desde el ``Federation Metadata XML`` archivo en el "
"``Public Key (Optional)`` box, a continuación el ``SAML RESPONSE`` "
"desplegable"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:119
msgid "Configure Role Mappings"
msgstr "Configure Role Mappings"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:121
msgid ""
"Role mappings will map Azure AD Groups to Morpheus Roles. Azure AD users "
"will be assigned Roles in |morpheus| upon signing in based on their Group "
"Membership in Azure AD."
msgstr ""
"Role mappings será map Azure AD Groups to Morpheus Roles. Azure AD users "
"será be assigned Roles in |morpheus| sobre signing in basado en their Group "
"Membership in Azure AD."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:123
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:134
msgid ""
"Use an Azure Groups ``Object ID``, not Group name, when entering Role "
"Mappings. Example: ``7626a4a2-b388-4d9b-a228-72ce9a33bd4b``"
msgstr ""
"Use un Azure Groups ``Object ID``, no Group nombre, cuando entering Role "
"Mappings. Example: ``7626a4a2-b388-4d9b-a228-72ce9a33bd4b``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:125
msgid "DEFAULT ROLE"
msgstr "DEFAULT ROLE"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:126
msgid ""
"Role a Azure AD user will be assigned by default upon signing in to "
"|morpheus| using this Identity Source."
msgstr ""
"Role un Azure AD user será be assigned por defecto sobre signing in to "
"|morpheus| using este Identity Source."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:127
msgid "REQUIRED AZURE AD GROUP OBJECT ID"
msgstr "REQUIRED AZURE AD GROUP OBJECT ID"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:128
msgid ""
"Object ID of Azure AD Group a user must be a member of to be authorized to "
"sign in to |morpheus|. Users not belonging to this Group will not be "
"authorized to login to |morpheus|. This field is optional, and if left "
"blank, any user from the Azure AD App will be able to sign in to |morpheus| "
"and will be assigned the Default Role if no Role Mappings match AD Group "
"membership."
msgstr ""
"Object ID of Azure AD Group un usuario debe be un member of to be authorized"
" to sign in to |morpheus|. Users no belonging to este Group no be authorized"
" to login to |morpheus|. This campo es opcional, y if left blank, cualquier "
"user desde el Azure AD App será be able to sign in to |morpheus| y será be "
"assigned el Default Role if no Role Mappings match AD Group membership."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:129
msgid "GROUP ASSERTION ATTRIBUTE NAME"
msgstr "GROUP ASSERTION ATTRIBUTE NAME"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:130
msgid ""
"Enter ``http://schemas.microsoft.com/ws/2008/06/identity/claims/groups`` for"
" Azure AD SSO"
msgstr ""
"Enter ``http://schemas.microsoft.com/ws/2008/06/identity/claims/groups`` "
"para Azure AD SSO"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:132
msgid "Additional Role Mappings"
msgstr "Additional Role Mappings"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:132
msgid ""
"The existing Roles in |morpheus| will be listed. To map a |morpheus| Role to"
" an Azure AD Group, enter the Object ID of the desired Azure AD Group in the"
" `Role Attribute Value` field for the corresponding |morpheus| Role."
msgstr ""
"The existente Roles in |morpheus| será be listed. To map un |morpheus| Role "
"to un Azure AD Group, enter el Object ID of el desired Azure AD Group in el "
"`Role Attribute Value` campo para el corresponding |morpheus| Role."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:136
msgid "ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION"
msgstr "ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:137
msgid ""
"When selected, Tenant users with appropriate rights to view and edit Roles "
"will have the ability to set role mapping for the Identity Source "
"integration. This allows the Tenant user to edit only the role mappings "
"without viewing or potentially editing the Identity Source configuration."
msgstr ""
"When seleccionado, Tenant users con apropiado rights to view y edit Roles "
"será tienen el ability to set role mapping para el Identity Source "
"integration. This allows el Tenant user to edit solo el rol mappings sin "
"viewing o potentially editing el Identity Source configuración."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:139
msgid "MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT"
msgstr "MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:139
msgid ""
"When selected, administrators can manually edit Roles for users created "
"through this identity source integration from the user detail page (|AdmUse|"
" > Selected user)."
msgstr ""
"When seleccionado, administrators puede manualmente edit Roles para users "
"creado a través de este fuente de identidad integration desde el usuario "
"página de detalles (|AdmUse| > Selected user)."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:141
msgid ""
"For more on Identity Source role mapping permissions, see the `associated "
"guide <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-to-enable-Subtenant-"
"admins-to-edit-Identity-Source-role-mapping?language=en_US>`_ in our "
"KnowledgeBase."
msgstr ""
"For más on Identity Source role mapping permisos, see el `associated guide "
"<https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-to-enable-Subtenant-admins-"
"to-edit-Identity-Source-role-mapping?language=en_US>`_ in our KnowledgeBase."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:143
msgid ""
"Once populated, select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES` and the SAML identity source"
" integration will be added. The Identity Source can be edited anytime to "
"deactivate or change Role Mappings or other values."
msgstr ""
"Once populated, select :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES` y el SAML fuente de "
"identidad integration será be agregado. The Identity Source puede be edited "
"anytime to deactivate o cambio Role Mappings o otro valores."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:145
msgid ""
"If Role mappings are edited after Azure AD SSO users have signed into "
"|morpheus|, currently logged in users will need to log out of |morpheus| for"
" the new Role mappings to take effect, when applicable."
msgstr ""
"If Role mappings son edited después de Azure AD SSO users tienen signed en "
"|morpheus|, actualmente logged in users será need to log out of |morpheus| "
"para el nuevo Role mappings to take effect, cuando applicable."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:147
msgid ""
"Under the ``Role Azure Group Mappings`` secton, verify the ``DEFAULT ROLE`` "
"dropdown has the role in |morpheus| selected that all users will be assigned"
" by default"
msgstr ""
"Bajo el ``Role Azure Group Mappings`` secton, verify el ``DEFAULT ROLE`` "
"desplegable tiene el rol in |morpheus| seleccionado que todos users será be "
"assigned por defecto"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:149
msgid ""
"It is recommended that this role contains no permissions, which ensures that"
" anyone who authenticates gets no access"
msgstr ""
"It es recomendado que este role contains no permisos, cual ensures que "
"anyone quien authenticates gets no acceso"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:151
msgid ""
"Under the ``Role Azure Group Mappings`` secton, you will see role names "
"listed.  Next to these are text boxes with ``Assertion Attribute Mappings`` "
"inside.  Enter group object IDs from Azure into these text boxes.  This will"
" map the Azure AD groups to specific roles in Morpheus"
msgstr ""
"Bajo el ``Role Azure Group Mappings`` secton, you será see role names "
"listed.  Next to estos son cuadro de textoes con ``Assertion Attribute "
"Mappings`` inside.  Enter group objeto IDs desde Azure en estos cuadro de "
"textoes.  This será map el Azure AD groups to específico roles in Morpheus"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:152
msgid "Finally, click ``Save Changes`` at the bottom of the page"
